{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-the-golf-residence","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"the-golf-residence","about":"Welcome to The Golf Residence by Fortimo, a luxurious residential haven within the prestigious Dubai Hills Estate. Offering a selection of exquisite 1, 2, and 3 bedroom apartments, this new 13-storey residential development embodies luxury and sophistication. With a rich Swiss legacy of property development excellence, Fortimo brings its unparalleled expertise and unwavering dedication to craft an exceptional living experience in Dubai. Indulge in a new standard of living where tranquillity meets luxury, as every aspect of this architectural marvel has been meticulously designed to provide residents with an unparalleled lifestyle. From contemporary design seamlessly blended with timeless elegance to meticulously crafted interiors, each detail is thoughtfully curated to ensure a life of grandeur and comfort. Discover a world where luxury knows no bounds, and experience the epitome of refined living at The Golf Residence.The Golf Residence by Fortimo is more than just a home; it’s an experience of luxury living. Immerse yourself in a lifestyle of indulgence, where every comfort and convenience is at your fingertips. Revel in the serenity of the lush surroundings, stroll along the landscaped pathways, or engage in a game of golf at the nearby championship golf course – the choices for recreation are endless. Embrace a life where luxury meets tranquillity, and let The Golf Residence become your haven of serenity in the heart of Dubai. Experience the epitome of refined living, where every aspect of your comfort and well-being has been meticulously considered to create an unparalleled residential retreat. Live life in extraordinary splendor at The Golf Residence by Fortimo. Welcome home.","price":1300000,"title":"The Golf Residence","bitrix":{"id":18,"pf_id":"are.2.